                  <p>Insert:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>guarantee of origin audit</i></b> means an audit under <ref href="#sec-125">section 125</ref>, 127 or 128 of the <i>Future Made in Australia (Guarantee of Origin) Act 2024</i>, or under an instrument made under that Act.</p>
                    <p><b><i>guarantee of origin audit report</i></b> means an audit report under <ref href="#sec-125">section 125</ref>, 127 or 128 of the <i>Future Made in Australia (Guarantee of Origin) Act 2024</i>, or under an instrument made under that Act.</p>
